msgstr "ტექსტური შეტყობინებების გაგზავნა ვიზიტის სტატუსის შესახებ"

#. module: planning_field_service_sms
#: model:sms.template,body:planning_field_service_sms.sms_template_data_planning_field_service_onway
msgid "{{ object.company_id.name }}: Our team is on its way to your intervention."
msgstr "{{ object.company_id.name }}: ჩვენი გუნდი უკვე გზაშია თქვენთან ვიზიტისთვის."

#. module: planning_field_service_sms
#: model:sms.template,body:planning_field_service_sms.sms_template_data_planning_field_service_intervention
msgid "{{ object.company_id.name }}: Your intervention is scheduled {{ ('for ' + format_datetime(object.start_datetime, dt_format='MMM d', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' from ' + format_time(object.start_datetime, time_format='short', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' to ' + format_time(object.end_datetime, time_format='short', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang)) if object.start_datetime and object.end_datetime and object.start_datetime.date() == object.end_datetime.date() else ('from ' + format_datetime(object.start_datetime, dt_format='MMM d', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' at ' + format_time(object.start_datetime, time_format='short', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' to ' + format_datetime(object.end_datetime, dt_format='MMM d', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' at ' + format_time(object.end_datetime, time_format='short', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang)) if object.start_datetime and object.end_datetime else '' }}"
msgstr "{{ object.company_id.name }}: თქვენი ვიზიტი დაგეგმილია {{ ('for ' + format_datetime(object.start_datetime, dt_format='MMM d', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' from ' + format_time(object.start_datetime, time_format='short', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' to ' + format_time(object.end_datetime, time_format='short', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang)) if object.start_datetime and object.end_datetime and object.start_datetime.date() == object.end_datetime.date() else ('from ' + format_datetime(object.start_datetime, dt_format='MMM d', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' at ' + format_time(object.start_datetime, time_format='short', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' to ' + format_datetime(object.end_datetime, dt_format='MMM d', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang) + ' at ' + format_time(object.end_datetime, time_format='short', tz=object.partner_id.tz, lang_code=object.partner_id.lang)) if object.start_datetime and object.end_datetime else '' }}"
